journey follow-session v1
route /sessions -> SessionList
step open
  click css:[data-journey="session"] [data-journey="title"]#0 via ["enter"]
  visible conversation
  visible composer
step header
  visible conversation/header
step meta
  visible conversation/head-meta
step details
  visible conversation/head-details
step activity
  visible activity
step actions WAIVED: a more-actions menu; every action behind it is a key in the TUI, enumerated by the `?` help overlay rather than a widget on the conversation.
step kinds
  visible css:[data-journey="conversation"] [data-journey="line"]#0
step line-actions WAIVED: per-line buttons appear on hover; the TUI acts on the focused line through keys (`m` pin, `y` copy, `b` bookmark), so there is no per-line widget to point at.
step filters
  visible filters/quick[assistant]
step filter-menu
  visible filters/filter-menu
step tools-only
  click filters/quick[assistant] via ["F", "space", "esc"]
  hidden conversation/line[assistant]
step tools-restore
  click filters/quick[assistant] via ["F", "space", "esc"]
  visible conversation/line[assistant]
step reply
  visible composer/message
